{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "ina, katuud ku laluma’an tayni i luma’",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925118",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "u sapikikung ni kakama ayza a demiad, kyu katuud ku tademaw tayni",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925119",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "lipahak tu ku balucu’ ! matenes tu caay kasasukazih!",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925120",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "hang ! yadah ku kawaw nu katuuday ayza, edapen isu ku katuuday",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925121",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "hang, matineng tu",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925122",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "a milasul kaku tu sapihica a tuud",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925123",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "edapen aku kisu",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925124",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "hang, kilulen kaku",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66335/925125",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
